  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="1091A"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-prov8">
        <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e98">Caput 8</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov8-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_1@1-3">Nunquid non sapientia,</quote>
            etc. Dominus palam locutus est mundo: et in occulto locutus est nihil. Quid ergo neglecto Evangelio ejus, ad haeresim et lasciviam miseri confluunt?
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov8-Dd1e111">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e113">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e115">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e117" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_2@1-2">In summis,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e120"><seg type="qs">In monte discipulos simul et turbas docuit</seg>, etc, usque ad <seg type="qs">qui contra eum in occulto loquuntur?</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov8-Dd1e129">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e131">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e133">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e135" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_4@1-4">O viri, ad vos.</quote>
            Ad viros clamat, id est ad strenuos verbi auditores: in utroque sexu namque <pb ed="#P" n="1091B"/> feminae, id est, fluxae mentes sapientiae verba percipere nequeunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov8-Dd1e142">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e144">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e146">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e148" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_5@1-2">Intelligite, parvuli,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e151"><seg type="qs">Manifestum est de Domino</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quos seducere valeat, quaerit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov8-Dd1e161">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e163">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e165">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e167" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_7@6-7">Labia mea.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e170"><seg type="qs">Duo testamenta</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ad praedicandum salutem universum aperta per orbem.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov8-Dd1e179">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e181">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e183">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e185" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_13@5-5">Arrogantiam.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e188"><seg type="qs">Arrogantiam et superbiam in eis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed juxta auditorum libitum sua verba commutant.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov8-Dd1e197">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e199">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e201">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e203" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_14@1-3">Meum est consilium.</quote>
            Non se extollat humana praesumptio: plenitudinem virtutum sola Dei sapientia possidet, ab hac humana infirmitas, <pb ed="#P" n="1091C"/> quidquid habet virtutis, accipit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov8-Dd1e210">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e212">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e214">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e216" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_15@1-3">Per me reges.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e219"><seg type="qs">Reges dicit apostolos</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ait enim: <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e225" source="http://scta.info/resource/io15_5@19-23">Sine me nihil potestis facere</quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov8-Dd1e231">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e233">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e235">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e237" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_17@1-2">Ego diligentes,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e240" source="http://scta.info/resource/io14_21@13-29">Qui diligit me, diligetur a Patre: et ego diligam eum, et manifestabo ei meipsum</quote>.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e244">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e246" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_17@7-7">Mane</quote>
            quippe ad sapientiam <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e249" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_17@8-8">vigilant,</quote> qui innovato mentis studio ad Christi visionem attingere satagunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov8-Dd1e254">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e256">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e258">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e260" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_18@1-3">Mecum sunt divitiae.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e263"><seg type="qs">Opes superbas, opes excelsas dicit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et promissa ipsius exspectamus in quibus est justitia.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov8-Dd1e273">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e275">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e277">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e279" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_22@1-3">Dominus possedit me.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e282"><seg type="qs">Hucusque locutus est parabolice ad Filium, nunc vero quia mentionem fecerat de sapientia, et non dixerat quae <pb ed="#P" n="1091D"/> esset, et quantae dignitatis, quasi incidenter ostendit et commendat eam secundum utramque naturam, scilicet divinam et humanam, dicit <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e287" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_22@1-1">Dominus,</quote> etc. Viae Domini sunt opera</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">caro enim ejus propter opera, divinitas ante opera.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov8-Dd1e296">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e298">Versus 31</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e300">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e302" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_31@1-3">Ludens in orbe.</quote>
            Quia cum tempora et creaturae orbis terrae coepissent, ipse, quod erat, in Patre Filius manebat: hoc ideo, ne quis eum cum creaturis et temporibus esse prohiberet.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov8-Dd1e307">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov8-Hd1e309">Versus 34</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov8-d1e311">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov8-Qd1e313" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov8_34@8-9">Ad fores.</quote>
            Scripturas, vel doctores; iidem et postes, sine quibus ad vitam, quam pollicetur, non valemus ingredi.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
